  "title": "Apples by the Fire",
  "description": "This recipe stuffs a tart apple with cinnamon and brown sugar, wraps it in foil, then places it in the coals of a fire for a camping or cookout dessert.",
  "authors": [
    "Mike Prawdzik"
  ],
